s of each transformer are within the matrix, so we can directly index into cells without extra bounds checks for the transformed coordinates.\n- This solution assumes the typical approach used for this problem and is efficient for N,M ≤ 500 and K ≤ 5e5 (time ~ O(K + N*M), memory ~ O(N*M)).",
